            "title": "CRITICAL threaded hole creation rules",
            "description": [
                "ALWAYS use Part.makeThreaded() for threaded holes - NEVER Part.makeCylinder() or PartDesign::Hole.",
                "Two input methods: (1) M-size (e.g. 'M6'): Lookup drill_diameter in threading reference table → radius = drill_diameter/2. (2) Direct radius (e.g. 'radius 2.5mm'): Use radius directly.",
